## 5. Bind contract as shipped
Dockerfile:39:ENV PORT=3000
docker-compose.yml:18:      - PORT=3000
(no HOSTNAME anywhere: Next's standalone server defaults to 0.0.0.0, which is
 what a published container port requires. A host install behind a proxy sets it.)

